{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type SchemaFromSource<T> = Prettify<{ [K in keyof T]: T[K] extends CollectionImpl<any, any, any, any, any> ? InferCollectionType<T[K]> : T[K] extends CollectionOptionsIdentity<any, any, any, any, any> ? InferCollectionType<T[K]> : T[K] extends QueryBuilder<infer TContext> ? GetRawResult<TContext> : never }>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L131","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:131"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SchemaFromSource - Converts a Source definition into a ContextSchema"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This transforms the input to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"from()"},{"type":"text","value":" into the schema format used throughout\nthe query builder. For each alias in the source:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Collections → their inferred TypeScript type"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Subqueries → their result type (what they would return if executed)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Prettify"},{"type":"text","value":" wrapper ensures clean type display in IDEs."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"Source.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Source"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype SchemaFromSource<T> = Prettify<{ [K in keyof T]: T[K] extends CollectionImpl<any, any, any, any, any> ? InferCollectionType<T[K]> : T[K] extends CollectionOptionsIdentity<any, any, any, any, any> ? InferCollectionType<T[K]> : T[K] extends QueryBuilder<infer TContext> ? GetRawResult<TContext> : never }>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:131](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L131)\n\nSchemaFromSource - Converts a Source definition into a ContextSchema\n\nThis transforms the input to `from()` into the schema format used throughout\nthe query builder. For each alias in the source:\n- Collections → their inferred TypeScript type\n- Subqueries → their result type (what they would return if executed)\n\nThe `Prettify` wrapper ensures clean type display in IDEs.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* [`Source`](Source.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SchemaFromSource\ntitle: SchemaFromSource\n---\n\n```ts\ntype SchemaFromSource<T> = Prettify<{ [K in keyof T]: T[K] extends CollectionImpl<any, any, any, any, any> ? InferCollectionType<T[K]> : T[K] extends CollectionOptionsIdentity<any, any, any, any, any> ? InferCollectionType<T[K]> : T[K] extends QueryBuilder<infer TContext> ? GetRawResult<TContext> : never }>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts:131](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/types.ts#L131)\n\nSchemaFromSource - Converts a Source definition into a ContextSchema\n\nThis transforms the input to `from()` into the schema format used throughout\nthe query builder. For each alias in the source:\n- Collections → their inferred TypeScript type\n- Subqueries → their result type (what they would return if executed)\n\nThe `Prettify` wrapper ensures clean type display in IDEs.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* [`Source`](Source.md)\n"}
